  "email_html_body": "\n    <div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, 'PingFang TC', 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; color: #1f2937;\">\n      <h1 style=\"color: #007bff; text-align:center; font-size: 24px;\">GitHub 開源科技報告</h1>\n      <p style=\"text-align:center; color:#666; margin-bottom: 30px;\">日期: 2026-09-27</p>\n    \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">辦公室應用</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">developer-roadmap</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 368,259</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">Developer Roadmap 提供互動式的學習路線圖、指南及其他教育內容，旨在協助開發人員在職涯中成長。它是規劃學習路徑和提升專業技能的實用工具。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/nilbuild/developer-roadmap\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/辦公室應用/developer-roadmap\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">寫程式</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">public-apis</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 483,574</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這是一個免費API的精選清單，為開發者提供探索和整合各種服務的便捷資源。它有助於加速軟體開發過程，是尋找特定功能API的寶貴工具。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/public-apis/public-apis\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/public-apis\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">freeCodeCamp</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 456,287</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">freeCodeCamp 提供開源的程式碼庫和課程，讓使用者能免費學習數學、程式設計與電腦科學。它是一個廣受歡迎的線上教育平台，致力於推廣免費的編程教育。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/freeCodeCamp/freeCodeCamp\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/freeCodeCamp\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">free-programming-books</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 397,872</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這個專案收集了大量免費提供的程式設計書籍，涵蓋各種程式語言與技術。對於希望擴展知識的開發者來說，它是一個方便且經濟的學習資源庫。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/EbookFoundation/free-programming-books\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/free-programming-books\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">awesome-python</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 323,317</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">Awesome Python 是一個精選的 Python 工具和函式庫清單，旨在幫助開發者快速找到解決特定問題的最佳方案。它是 Python 生態系的寶貴指引，能有效提升開發效率。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/vinta/awesome-python\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/awesome-python\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">awesome-selfhosted</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Unknown | Star: 322,017</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這是一個精選的開源軟體和網路服務清單，可供使用者在自己的伺服器上架設。它為追求資料主權和自訂性的使用者提供了豐富的自架解決方案，涵蓋多種應用場景。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/awesome-selfhosted/awesome-selfhosted\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/awesome-selfhosted\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">project-based-learning</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 284,779</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">Project-based learning 是一個精選的專案導向教學清單，鼓勵透過實際操作來學習程式設計。它提供了一種有效的學習方式，幫助初學者和經驗豐富的開發者透過實作鞏固知識。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/practical-tutorials/project-based-learning\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/project-based-learning\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">disktree</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Rust | Star: 1,287</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">disktree 是一個以 Rust 和 GPUI 開發的硬碟空間分析工具，它以樹狀圖形式視覺化呈現磁碟使用情況，幫助用戶輕鬆找到並清理佔用空間的檔案。它是一款高效的系統管理工具，適用於優化儲存空間。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/tobi/disktree\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/disktree\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">PDoomVideo</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: JavaScript | Star: 1,043</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">PDoomVideo 提供了使用 Claude Opus 5.5 製作「I&#x27;m Upping My P(doom)」音樂影片的原始碼。這個專案展示了如何結合AI技術來進行創意內容生成，對於探索AI在藝術和媒體創作中的應用具有參考價值。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/JohnHeibel/PDoomVideo\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/PDoomVideo\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">kryvora-node</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Go | Star: 886</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">Kryvora Node 提供了 Kryvora 網路節點的參考客戶端守護程式和驗證工作器。它構成了該網路的基礎設施，確保了網路的穩定運作與資料的可靠驗證。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/kryvora-network/kryvora-node\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/kryvora-node\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">AI Skill</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">jev-chat-jarvis</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Kotlin | Star: 6,671</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">Jev Chat Jarvis 是一個手機上的對話副駕，能在社交通訊軟體中讀懂對話、提供候選回覆並一鍵填入，所有操作皆由用戶決定。它以非侵入式方式增強用戶的溝通效率，是實用的對話輔助AI工具。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/jev-chat/jev-chat-jarvis\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Skill/jev-chat-jarvis\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">CLM</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 1,577</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">雖然沒有描述，但從專案名稱 Contrastive-LM/CLM 推斷，這是一個關於對比式語言模型的研究或實作專案。它可能專注於提升語言理解和生成能力，值得關注其在自然語言處理領域的潛力。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Contrastive-LM/CLM\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Skill/CLM\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">deepopen</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 1,035</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">DeepOpen 是一個多語言、非自迴歸的 System 1 決策引擎，專為結構化決策場景設計。它致力於提供快速直觀的判斷能力，對於需要高效處理固定模式決策的應用極具價值。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/deepopen-com/deepopen\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Skill/deepopen\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">claude-opus-5-5-demo</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: JavaScript | Star: 808</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這個專案是 Claude Opus 5.5 的展示範例，旨在呈現該先進AI模型的性能與潛力。它為開發者和研究者提供了直接體驗 Claude Opus 5.5 功能的機會，有助於理解其應用場景。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/riba2534/claude-opus-5-5-demo\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Skill/claude-opus-5-5-demo\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">AI Agent</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">openclaw</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 390,590</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">OpenClaw 是一個聲稱能跨作業系統和平台「真正做事」的 AI 專案，強調其自主行動能力。它值得關注，因為它探索了讓AI在多種環境中執行複雜任務的潛力。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/openclaw\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">superpowers</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Shell | Star: 291,954</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">Superpowers 是一個代理能力框架及軟體開發方法論，強調其在實際應用中的有效性。它為開發具備自主決策能力的AI代理提供了結構化的途徑與實踐指導。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/obra/superpowers\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/superpowers\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">skills</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Shell | Star: 270,267</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這個專案收錄了來自開發者`.agents`目錄的「真實工程師技能」，暗示這是一組為AI代理設計的具體能力或工具。它為希望提升AI代理效能和應用場景的開發者提供了實用參考。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/mattpocock/skills\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/skills\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">unreal-agent</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Go | Star: 1,965</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">Unreal Agent 是一個以異步（async-first）為設計理念的代理程式框架，專為開發高效能AI代理而設計。它提供建構和管理自主性AI代理的基礎設施，適合需要處理並行任務的複雜應用。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/unreallabsai/unreal-agent\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/unreal-agent\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">magpie</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Go | Star: 1,015</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">Magpie 旨在將各種AI代理模型整合於一處，例如在選單列中調用 DeepSeek 上的 Codex 或 Kimi 上的 Claude Code。它為AI代理提供了統一的模型存取和管理介面，簡化了跨模型的操作與協作。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/yetone/magpie\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/magpie\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">golive-skill</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 978</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">GoLive Skill 是一個開源的代理技能，協助將AI代理產品部署上線，涵蓋託管、資料庫、域名、電子郵件和支付等環節。它提供一套從偵測到驗證的自動化流程，讓代理構建的產品能快速投入使用。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/mikehasa/golive-skill\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/golive-skill\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            </div>"
}